<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">P. D’Oro, M. Schwarzer, E. Nikishin, P. Bacon, M. G. Bellemare, and A. Courville</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_year"> (2023)</span>
